{"seq":3,"slug":"project-lifecycle","title":"项目生命周期与可持续性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/foundations/project-lifecycle","wordCount":1320,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"项目生命周期与可持续性\">项目生命周期与可持续性</h1><p>2026 年 3 月，Kubernetes 生态里两件事接连发生：Ingress NGINX 这个被无数集群依赖的入口控制器宣布退役，3 月之后不再有安全补丁；几乎同时，被全球关键企业系统使用的 External Secrets Operator 冻结了所有更新——四名维护者全部倦怠，只剩一人勉强活跃（见 <a href=\"https://itsfoss.com/news/open-source-developers-are-exhausted/\">itsfoss.com</a>）。这些项目没有死于技术过时，而是死于生命周期管理的失败：它们走到了衰退期，却没人提前规划传承。维护者如果看不清项目处在哪个阶段，就会在错误的时间用错误的力气。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>任何开源项目都沿着一条可识别的曲线移动，每个阶段对维护者的要求截然不同。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[诞生 Inception&lt;br/&gt;一个人的实验] --&gt; B[成长 Growth&lt;br/&gt;用户与贡献者涌入]&#10;  B --&gt; C[成熟 Maturity&lt;br/&gt;稳定/广泛依赖]&#10;  C --&gt; D{走向何方?}&#10;  D --&gt; E[衰退 Decline&lt;br/&gt;维护者流失]&#10;  D --&gt; F[传承 Succession&lt;br/&gt;团队/基金会接手]&#10;  E --&gt; G[归档 Archived&lt;br/&gt;明确停止维护]&#10;  F --&gt; C\">graph TD\n  A[诞生 Inception&lt;br/&gt;一个人的实验] --&gt; B[成长 Growth&lt;br/&gt;用户与贡献者涌入]\n  B --&gt; C[成熟 Maturity&lt;br/&gt;稳定/广泛依赖]\n  C --&gt; D{走向何方?}\n  D --&gt; E[衰退 Decline&lt;br/&gt;维护者流失]\n  D --&gt; F[传承 Succession&lt;br/&gt;团队/基金会接手]\n  E --&gt; G[归档 Archived&lt;br/&gt;明确停止维护]\n  F --&gt; C</pre><p>注意从成熟期出来有两条岔路：要么主动传承、回到可持续的成熟状态，要么被动衰退、最终归档。Ingress NGINX 走的是后一条，但它至少做对了一件事——明确公告退役，而不是悄无声息地腐烂，这对下游已是负责任的做法。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>主要矛盾</th>\n<th>维护者该做的</th>\n<th>该避免的</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>诞生</td>\n<td>没人知道、没人用</td>\n<td>快速迭代、降低尝试门槛</td>\n<td>过早上重流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成长</td>\n<td>涌入超过承载力</td>\n<td>建<a href=\"../community/contributor-onboarding\">贡献者管道</a>、定治理</td>\n<td>当瓶颈、事事亲为</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>成熟</td>\n<td>稳定与创新的张力</td>\n<td>严守<a href=\"../engineering/versioning-releases\">版本契约</a>、分散权力</td>\n<td>突然引入破坏性变更</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>衰退</td>\n<td>维护者耗尽</td>\n<td>诚实公告、寻求<a href=\"../practice/burnout-delegation\">继任</a></td>\n<td>假装一切正常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>归档</td>\n<td>下游何去何从</td>\n<td>明确标记、指引迁移</td>\n<td>静默腐烂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bus-factor-项目最脆弱的数字\">bus factor：项目最脆弱的数字</h2><p>衡量一个项目可持续性的最尖锐指标，是它的 bus factor（公交车系数）——多少个核心人物同时消失，项目就会停摆。这个略带黑色幽默的名字背后是一个残酷的现实：如前文<a href=\"what-is-maintainership\">维护者角色</a>所述，绝大多数关键开源项目的 bus factor 等于 1。</p>\n<p>可以把它形式化。设项目有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个贡献者，第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个人掌握的不可替代知识占比为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（满足 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>k</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sum_{i=1}^{n} k_i = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.104em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>），则 bus factor 大致是使累计知识超过某阈值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>τ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span></span></span>（常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span>）所需的最少人数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>bus factor</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>:</mo><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>m</mi></munderover><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>≥</mo><mi>τ</mi><mo fence=\"true\">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{bus factor} = \\min\\left\\{ m : \\sum_{i=1}^{m} k_{(i)} \\ge \\tau \\right\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">bus factor</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0277em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.6514em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∑</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k_{(i)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0496em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.0315em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是按掌握知识降序排列后的占比。当一个人掌握了过半知识，bus factor 就是 1，项目命悬一线。提升它的唯一办法是主动分散知识——文档化、结对评审、轮值，这些动作贯穿<a href=\"../community/code-review-pr\">代码评审</a>和<a href=\"../practice/burnout-delegation\">继任规划</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可持续性的三根支柱\">可持续性的三根支柱</h2><p>一个项目能否长期活下去，取决于三种资源的供给是否跟得上需求的增长。它们相互关联，缺一根都会塌。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>人的可持续</strong>：是否有足够的活跃维护者分担负载。这是最稀缺的资源，External Secrets Operator 正是死在这里。详见<a href=\"../practice/burnout-delegation\">倦怠与委派</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>钱的可持续</strong>：维护者能否获得物质支持，从而把时间投入项目而不必另谋生计。2026 年约六成维护者无偿工作，这是系统性危机，见<a href=\"../practice/funding-sustainability\">资金与可持续性</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>技术的可持续</strong>：代码库是否保持可维护——测试、CI、文档、可控的技术债。技术债累积会让每一次贡献都更痛苦，间接加速人的流失。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这三根支柱构成一个反馈循环：钱能换来人的时间，人的时间能偿还技术债，健康的技术债又降低新人门槛、带来更多人。反过来，任何一根的崩塌都会拖垮其余两根——这正是衰退期的典型景象。</p>\n<h2 id=\"体面地结束-归档的艺术\">体面地结束：归档的艺术</h2><p>维护者很少被教导如何结束一个项目，但这是生命周期里同样重要的一环。一个项目走到尽头时，最负责任的做法不是删库或装死，而是给下游一个清晰、有尊严的退出。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[维护者决定停止] --&gt; B[公开公告: 何时停, 为何停]&#10;  B --&gt; C[标记仓库为 archived]&#10;  C --&gt; D{有继任者或替代品?}&#10;  D --&gt;|有| E[在 README 顶部指向迁移路径]&#10;  D --&gt;|无| F[标注最后安全版本与已知风险]&#10;  E --&gt; G[保留只读历史]&#10;  F --&gt; G\">flowchart TD\n  A[维护者决定停止] --&gt; B[公开公告: 何时停, 为何停]\n  B --&gt; C[标记仓库为 archived]\n  C --&gt; D{有继任者或替代品?}\n  D --&gt;|有| E[在 README 顶部指向迁移路径]\n  D --&gt;|无| F[标注最后安全版本与已知风险]\n  E --&gt; G[保留只读历史]\n  F --&gt; G</pre><p>把仓库标记为只读归档、在 README 顶部写明状态和迁移建议、保留可追溯的历史——这些动作花不了多少时间，却能让成千上万下游用户做出知情决策。它和<a href=\"what-is-maintainership\">维护者隐性契约</a>首尾呼应：你不欠用户无限维护，但你欠他们一份诚实的状态说明。能漂亮地结束一个项目，和能开始一个项目同样是成熟维护者的标志。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>开源项目沿「诞生→成长→成熟→（衰退/传承）→归档」的曲线移动，每阶段对维护者的要求截然不同。</li>\n<li>成熟期有两条岔路：主动传承回到可持续，或被动衰退走向归档；2026 年多个关键项目走了后者。</li>\n<li>bus factor 是最尖锐的可持续性指标，公式为使累计知识达阈值的最少人数；多数关键项目它等于 1。</li>\n<li>可持续性靠人、钱、技术三根支柱，三者构成反馈循环，一根塌则全塌。</li>\n<li>体面地归档——公告、标记只读、指引迁移——是负责任维护者的标志，与维护者的隐性契约首尾呼应。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"项目生命周期与可持续性","id":"项目生命周期与可持续性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"bus factor：项目最脆弱的数字","id":"bus-factor-项目最脆弱的数字"},{"level":2,"text":"可持续性的三根支柱","id":"可持续性的三根支柱"},{"level":2,"text":"体面地结束：归档的艺术","id":"体面地结束-归档的艺术"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"许可证与治理模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/foundations/licenses-governance"},"next":{"title":"贡献者引导与成长","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/open-source-maintainership/community/contributor-onboarding"}}